# Release workflow — DISABLED while the repo is private.
#
# Rename this file to `release.yml` (drop the `.disabled` suffix) and enable
# trusted publishing on PyPI (https://docs.pypi.org/trusted-publishers/) once
# the repo is public and all sibling dependencies (l2co-tasks, bessaplots,
# the modern f3dasm) have been published to PyPI.
#
# On a `v*` tag, this workflow runs the test matrix one more time, builds
# sdist + wheel with `uv build`, verifies them with `twine check`, and then
# uploads to PyPI using GitHub's OIDC trusted-publisher flow — no PyPI
# token is stored as a secret.
#
